          "ruleId": "review-note",
          "ruleIndex": 0,
          "kind": "informational",
          "level": "none",
          "guid": "mt23yofsbzp1hu7o",
          "message": {
            "text": "Cleanup moved from an imperative close() to handle.result.then() so every dismissal path runs it. Under kerfjs/overlay the modal can close three ways — the #te-close button, Escape, or a backdrop click — and only the button path would go through a hand-rolled close(). Resolving the save-on-close + disposeLivePreview() + onDone() off handle.result (which overlay() resolves on any dismissal) guarantees a dirty edit is still persisted when the user hits Escape or clicks the backdrop, matching the pre-migration behavior where the single close() was wired to all three.\n",
            "markdown": "Cleanup moved from an imperative `close()` to `handle.result.then()` so every dismissal path runs it. Under kerfjs/overlay the modal can close three ways — the `#te-close` button, Escape, or a backdrop click — and only the button path would go through a hand-rolled `close()`. Resolving the save-on-close + `disposeLivePreview()` + `onDone()` off `handle.result` (which overlay() resolves on *any* dismissal) guarantees a dirty edit is still persisted when the user hits Escape or clicks the backdrop, matching the pre-migration behavior where the single `close()` was wired to all three.\n"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/client/settings/themeEditor.tsx"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 111,
                  "endLine": 118,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "    void handle.result.then(() => {\n      disposeLivePreview();\n      if (dirty) void save();\n      if (onDone !== undefined) onDone();\n    });\n\n    async function save(): Promise<void> {\n      if (!dirty) return;"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "tags": [
              "rationale"
            ]
